{
  "title": "Jazzy Greek Ground Meat Pastitsio",
  "description": "A roasted, crunchy, lazy-sunday Greek dish featuring clear honey, perfect for a diabetic-friendly meal. The classic macaroni and ground meat casserole is elevated with a beautifully caramelized honey crust.",
  "cuisine": "Greek",
  "diet": [
