  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a medium skillet, cook the ground meat over medium-high heat, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks, until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the onion and garlic to the skillet and cook, stirring occasionally, until the onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the flour, oregano, thyme, salt, and pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cooked macaroni to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the macaroni mixture to a large baking dish and top with the bechamel sauce and grated cheese.",
    "Drizzle the clear honey over the top of the dish.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 25-30 minutes, or until the top is golden brown and the casserole is hot and bubbly."
  ],
